    "text": "Match the following.<br />&nbsp;<table border=\"1\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List &ndash; I</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List &ndash; II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td>The number of polynomials f(x) with non &ndash; negative integer coefficients of degree <math><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math> satisfying f(0) =0 and <math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(P)</td>\t\t\t<td>8</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td>The number of point in the interval <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math> at which <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math> attains its maximum value, is</td>\t\t\t<td>(Q)</td>\t\t\t<td>2</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> equals</td>\t\t\t<td>(R)</td>\t\t\t<td>4</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td><math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></munderover><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></munderover><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(S)</td>\t\t\t<td>0</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>",
